{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terentius Duval is back in this open world gta parody game. Third person shooter game in fictional place called Valkeala. Terentius main mission is find 10 money bags which gives steam achievements. Also he has 4000$ money in start and no single weapon, his first mission is to find weapon shop and buy weapons. Terentius can get more money from shooting npc guys in open world. Some npc has weapons and they shoot back. For collecting money Terentius can go to Valkeala car shop and buy different cars. There are cheap cars and expensive cars. Also there is car paint store. Terentius can also rob and steal cars.. So can you be the biggest gangsta collect all money bags and buy most fastest cars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 hidden money bags which gives achievements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big open world which contains different areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >car to drive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >npc walking. Some guys may shooting with different weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player has 4000$ money in start, he can buy weapons and cars and collect more money to buy more faster cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car painting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Find money bag 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3915970/b72c1250bed3a437514226cca18313a136f63f3f.jpg"},{"name":"Find money bag 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3915970/96f6233bd67c462e707646d7cb9f0da3ef1c7c55.jpg"},{"name":"Find money bag 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea